{"bvid": "BV1mi4y117z1", "title": "（亲测）最常见的英语发音错误，纠正立即改善口音", "duration": 730, "subs": [{"cid": 509473746, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 331, "body": [{"from": 0.32, "to": 0.92, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "Hello", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 0.92, "to": 1.28, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "大家好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 1.28, "to": 2.12, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "这里是铃木", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.12, "to": 4.079, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "今天向大家分享一个嗯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.079, "to": 5.579, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "超级影响英语口音的同时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.579, "to": 7.47, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "还有非常常见的一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.47, "to": 11.19, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "那就是不把单子最后的辅音给念清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.19, "to": 12.18, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "或者念出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.18, "to": 13.71, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以自己测试一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.29, "to": 17.32, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "可以暂停视频读一下这个很简单的一个词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.32, "to": 21.61, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "girl女孩在读完之后能注意下自己的舌头在哪里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.61, "to": 23.5, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "因为这个词是以L结尾的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.5, "to": 24.16, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "讲道理呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.16, "to": 24.76, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "你读完之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.76, "to": 25.9, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "你的舌头应该是在上面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.9, "to": 26.93, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "再比方说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.42, "to": 31.12, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "谁都是在上面的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.12, "to": 31.96, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "那如果你没有", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.96, "to": 33.55, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "那说明你应该大大少少", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.55, "to": 35.38, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "大大小小是有这个问题的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.38, "to": 36.34, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "那我有一个好消息", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 36.34, "to": 37.26, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "一个坏消息", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.26, "to": 39.48, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "好消息呢就是说这个问题是可以解决的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.48, "to": 41.46, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "我自己以前啊就饱受其害", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.46, "to": 42.01, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.01, "to": 43.03, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "也有这个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.03, "to": 44.74, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢我是自己解决了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.74, "to": 46.21, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "那坏消息呢就是说这个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.21, "to": 48.04, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "但可能没有那么好解决", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.04, "to": 50.98, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "还是有像我其实也走了不少弯路的啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 50.98, "to": 52.36, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "今天我都会分享给大家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 52.36, "to": 54.4, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "我会接下来呢会分享我自己", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 54.4, "to": 56.55, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "学习的经过的三个阶段", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.55, "to": 58.95, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢在视频的最后呢会告诉大家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.95, "to": 61.95, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "分享大家一个必须要知道英语连诵的技巧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.95, "to": 62.97, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "学会这技巧呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.97, "to": 66.53, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "能够嗯很很明显的间接解决这个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.53, "to": 69.14, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "大家记得看到视频最后啊保证都是干货", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.14, "to": 71.81, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "第一个阶段呢也是大部分人都所处的阶段", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 71.81, "to": 75.429, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "就是压根没有意识到自己漏读了这些音像", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 75.429, "to": 77.859, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "前段时间有一次我和一个朋友在喝咖啡嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.859, "to": 79.569, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "他忽然冷不丁冒出了一句", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.569, "to": 81.53, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "这里的咖啡local不local", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 81.53, "to": 82.91, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "我当时真的想了很久", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.91, "to": 84.02, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "不知道什么意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.02, "to": 88.25, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "其实他想说的是local local地方不地方", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.25, "to": 91.2, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "但他们没有意识到自己这个L音是没有读的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.2, "to": 93.36, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "我听出来是LOCO", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.36, "to": 94.97, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "然后好巧不巧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.97, "to": 96.23, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "这其实也是一个词啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.23, "to": 96.89, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "比较冷门", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.89, "to": 98.18, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "意思是神经病的意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.18, "to": 99.84, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "我当时真的想了很久", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 99.84, "to": 101.64, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "这个咖啡神经不神经", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.64, "to": 102.39, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "我当时在想", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 102.39, "to": 104.5, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "这是什么新型的俚语吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.58, "to": 106.92, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "其实从语言学上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 106.92, "to": 109.68, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "我们中国人说英语不把单词有的辅音给念出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 109.68, "to": 110.76, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "其实挺好理解的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.76, "to": 112.71, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "大家有没有注意到就是中文啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.71, "to": 114.53, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "一个字就是一个音节", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 114.53, "to": 116.81, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢很少有辅音结尾的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.81, "to": 117.83, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "我想了很久了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 117.83, "to": 119.89, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "输出一个N偶尔会出现", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.89, "to": 123.09, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "像比方说成别的辅音都是不会出现的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.09, "to": 124.11, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "不过粉丝的事", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.11, "to": 127.35, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "这N音啊反而是我猜猜觉得是最难的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.35, "to": 128.67, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "这是我后来才知道", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.67, "to": 131.6, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "就是原来英语的N跟中弹的是不一样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.6, "to": 134.12, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "呃我们这个最后说实际情况呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.12, "to": 136.6, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "我个人观察跟个人经验了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.6, "to": 141.95, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "我发现比较有困难的主要有L嗯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 141.95, "to": 142.82, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "还有爆破音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.82, "to": 145.7, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "比方说特特克格之类的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.7, "to": 147.68, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "那这些呢可以分为两两大类", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.68, "to": 150.22, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "一类就是嗯大家可能是念确实念了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 150.22, "to": 151.24, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "但是念的不清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 151.24, "to": 152.8, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "还有擂主石家根就没有念", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.8, "to": 156.12, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "那我们先从最简单的开始就是吃毒了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.12, "to": 157.62, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "但是那个没有读清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.62, "to": 158.79, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "就是爆破音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 158.79, "to": 163.549, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "爆破音呢比方说P可跟大部分人读都是读了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 163.549, "to": 165.4, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "但是呢并没有爆破", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.4, "to": 169.06, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "而是用A这个原因呢去代替模拟", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 169.06, "to": 170.62, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "我自己以前就是这样子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.62, "to": 171.79, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "也不怕大家笑话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 171.79, "to": 174.64, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "我以前在美国读高中的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.64, "to": 177.01, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "最困扰我的一个问题之一就是这个了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 177.01, "to": 178.54, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "那会儿我的一个住家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.54, "to": 180.0, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "他爸爸叫迈克", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.019, "to": 182.959, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢他当时一直纠正我的发音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 182.959, "to": 186.39, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "说我说mike这个词说的不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 186.39, "to": 187.71, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "我在后面加了个A", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 187.71, "to": 190.22, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "让这个变成了一个双音节的词了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 190.22, "to": 191.72, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "那当时我真的很困惑", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 191.72, "to": 195.26, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "一方面呢道理我是懂得mike是个单音节的词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 195.26, "to": 196.97, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "然后K后面的音量是不发音的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 196.97, "to": 199.66, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "另外一方面我是感觉不发这个A的音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 199.66, "to": 200.8, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "怎么发K的音呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 200.8, "to": 204.199, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "在我脑海里面就是K就是要跟一个E", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 204.199, "to": 205.759, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "这个音跟W比起来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 205.759, "to": 206.869, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "K对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 206.869, "to": 208.549, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "是有E的音哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.549, "to": 210.88, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "是经过好几年之后啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.88, "to": 213.34, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "我才知道此俄非彼俄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 213.34, "to": 217.1, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "就是肯看后面那个AA的音啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.1, "to": 219.47, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "并不是来自于大家读一个元音A", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 219.47, "to": 221.66, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "而来自于K爆破音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 221.66, "to": 225.56, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "我们中国人是没有发音爆破的这个习惯嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 225.88, "to": 228.16, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "所以会产生这个误区啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 228.16, "to": 230.32, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "然后我觉得应该有很多人会有这个", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 230.32, "to": 231.43, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "也有这样的困惑", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 231.43, "to": 234.389, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "因为大家去问一个英语的母语者啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 234.389, "to": 237.629, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "他们心目中最标准的一个忠实口音是什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 237.629, "to": 239.609, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "就是喜欢在单词口音都加个A", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 239.609, "to": 240.689, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "我现在来看哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 240.689, "to": 242.579, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "大家并不是想着要加A", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 242.579, "to": 245.079, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "而是以为哦就是要这么读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 245.079, "to": 247.389, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "他们是在模拟这个爆破音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 247.389, "to": 250.539, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "爆破音呢顾名思义就是要把自己给喷出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 250.539, "to": 251.379, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "爆破出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.379, "to": 255.099, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以拿一张这样子的餐巾纸啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 255.099, "to": 256.119, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "把它弄薄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.119, "to": 257.349, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "弄得很薄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 257.349, "to": 258.639, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "然后放到嘴边上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 258.639, "to": 259.659, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "自己可以试一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 259.659, "to": 261.4, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "比方说卖", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.8, "to": 269.54, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "哦大家看一下这个餐巾纸能是怎么动的啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.54, "to": 270.74, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "如果他一动也没有动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 270.74, "to": 272.0, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "说明你压根就没有爆破", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.0, "to": 272.9, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "要是动的很少", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.9, "to": 274.679, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "说明你爆破的力度不够多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 274.679, "to": 276.869, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "需要那个再更明显一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 276.869, "to": 278.339, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "但在练习的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 278.339, "to": 280.169, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "平时啊如果有这个问题的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.169, "to": 282.72, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "可以试着就慢慢的读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 282.72, "to": 285.21, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢在爆破之前的停顿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 285.21, "to": 287.85, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢尽量就夸张一点去爆破", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 287.85, "to": 289.17, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "平时训练夸张一点嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 289.17, "to": 293.96, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "这样子嗯真真真实说话的时候再正常一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 293.96, "to": 295.64, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "比方说妈", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 297.56, "to": 301.42, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "fate就是在爆破之前停顿一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 301.42, "to": 303.84, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "让自己就爆破能更夸张一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 303.84, "to": 305.7, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "接下来到我们的第二个阶段", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 305.7, "to": 307.98, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "就那会儿呢我英语其实已经可以了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 307.98, "to": 309.48, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "我托福有106", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 309.48, "to": 311.98, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "然后我CD当时考了2200多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 312.32, "to": 314.78, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "但是呢当时看多了营销号", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 314.78, "to": 316.7, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "再加上自己一些天才的想法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.7, "to": 320.05, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "忽然觉得英语哦得看你说的快不快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.05, "to": 321.94, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "然后那些音呢能吞就吞", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 321.94, "to": 323.679, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "这样显得你更加厉害", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 323.679, "to": 328.15, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "这反而导致了我的那个英语口音呢不进反退哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 328.15, "to": 329.17, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "我印象很深", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 329.17, "to": 330.52, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "当时去读大学", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 330.52, "to": 331.33, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "读大一的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 331.33, "to": 332.74, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "有个同班同学问我", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.74, "to": 334.39, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "因为我以前是不是在法国待过", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 335.42, "to": 339.8, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "因为法语单词有的辅音都是都都是不念的啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 339.8, "to": 341.039, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "印象特别的深", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 341.039, "to": 343.499, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "如果用一个词来形容第二个阶段呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 343.499, "to": 345.85, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "那就是本末倒置了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 345.85, "to": 348.79, "sid": 163, "loca